cking_cotton_in_Georgia%2C_circa_1880.jpg/500px-Family_of_African_American_picking_cotton_in_Georgia%2C_circa_1880.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Plantation complexes were reliant on the exploitation of enslaved labor. Pictured is a family of slaves in a cotton field in Georgia, c. 1850.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFamily_of_African_American_picking_cotton_in_Georgia%2C_circa_1880.jpg"}],"sounds":{}}}